{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"goodnight-little-compound","version":1,"title":"Goodnight, Little Compound","ageTiers":["3-4"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"The sun goes down, the sky turns gold. The compound is quiet, the stories are told.","sentences":["The sun goes down, the sky turns gold.","The compound is quiet, the stories are told."],"image":"sha256:dff4947c6928b7d5036916b96f6da473f41c47cc9d78a28c2003ed82ad99c936","alt":"A golden sunset over a quiet family compound with a mango tree.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:3bab6025c9e2924a283a6f4b0da2b42947f4d59922850de1e7fd0f38c27cb990","durationMs":9080,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4489],[4489,9080]],"words":[[0,299],[299,598],[598,997],[997,1895],[1895,2194],[2194,2493],[2493,2992],[2992,4489],[4489,4788],[4788,5586],[5586,5786],[5786,6784],[6784,7083],[7083,7781],[7781,8080],[8080,9080]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"Goodnight to the goats, all snug in their pen. Goodnight to the hen and her chicks again.","sentences":["Goodnight to the goats, all snug in their pen.","Goodnight to the hen and her chicks again."],"image":"sha256:a9e4d44fd01c2ac023c69f8ff473231c64b6b7b822082794f9c8759657e46896","alt":"Goats settled in a wooden pen and a hen with her chicks beside it.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:6a8f556d623bd5cbb13bb0da52f21fe68f5643595b119777da247ce6b336711b","durationMs":7760,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4386],[4386,7760]],"words":[[0,759],[759,928],[928,1181],[1181,2024],[2024,2277],[2277,2614],[2614,2783],[2783,3205],[3205,4386],[4386,5145],[5145,5314],[5314,5567],[5567,5820],[5820,6073],[6073,6326],[6326,6832],[6832,7760]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"Goodnight to the mango tree, tall and green. Goodnight to the moon, the brightest I’ve seen.","sentences":["Goodnight to the mango tree, tall and green.","Goodnight to the moon, the brightest I’ve seen."],"image":"sha256:a35a3529b3b605c5b750895d95b85c03b777a2053634f8e8d0d9e3568834a196","alt":"A tall mango tree against a dark blue sky with a bright full moon.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:04929ff3c66ee5dce38e2e5b8ef535f7926cb21ea28102ac8993365eff71776a","durationMs":8480,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4369],[4369,8480]],"words":[[0,771],[771,942],[942,1199],[1199,1627],[1627,2398],[2398,2741],[2741,2998],[2998,4369],[4369,5140],[5140,5311],[5311,5568],[5568,6339],[6339,6596],[6596,7367],[7367,7624],[7624,8480]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"Goodnight to the pots, all washed and dry. Goodnight to the bats in the dark, dark sky.","sentences":["Goodnight to the pots, all washed and dry.","Goodnight to the bats in the dark, dark sky."],"image":"sha256:cc98fb3ce45c8fe5e1b689a7afda40c65855052685f97c1851a41aca781337f4","alt":"Clean pots stacked by a doorway while bats fly across the night sky.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:01fc2e0a5697dc9d5d8ad5b9fb11530fa8300a2bfef3b60490f3b62a5d67eec3","durationMs":9240,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4818],[4818,9240]],"words":[[0,885],[885,1082],[1082,1377],[1377,2262],[2262,2557],[2557,3147],[3147,3442],[3442,4818],[4818,5703],[5703,5900],[5900,6195],[6195,6588],[6588,6785],[6785,7080],[7080,7965],[7965,8358],[8358,9240]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"Goodnight to the drum, so quiet and still. Goodnight to the path at the bottom of the hill.","sentences":["Goodnight to the drum, so quiet and still.","Goodnight to the path at the bottom of the hill."],"image":"sha256:87715f908b447e56e9e79fab11f13941b1e761b3315c1588e0c44c8ea8b11ff3","alt":"A resting drum on a mat and a path leading into the dark hills.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:84d95708ae0c802ae29db56b16bf275b8e7f95fb2b75949c376c3ff0d4e22695","durationMs":8000,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4214],[4214,8000]],"words":[[0,774],[774,946],[946,1204],[1204,1978],[1978,2150],[2150,2580],[2580,2838],[2838,4214],[4214,4988],[4988,5160],[5160,5418],[5418,5762],[5762,5934],[5934,6192],[6192,6708],[6708,6880],[6880,7138],[7138,8000]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"Goodnight, Mama. Goodnight, Papa. Goodnight, Grandma, with a squeeze and a hug.","sentences":["Goodnight, Mama.","Goodnight, Papa.","Goodnight, Grandma, with a squeeze and a hug."],"image":"sha256:3662ceaed3a4caa6b6b86bc3e019885f1b37aea7aec5067229077a68d193149e","alt":"A family hugs a small child at the door of a warm, lamplit room.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:598f807ccf5bbafe0e2d2da8147859cd78f0592edfcc833656d51d4d6260465a","durationMs":7160,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,1871],[1871,3742],[3742,7160]],"words":[[0,903],[903,1871],[1871,2774],[2774,3742],[3742,4645],[4645,5419],[5419,5677],[5677,5806],[5806,6258],[6258,6452],[6452,6581],[6581,7160]]}}},{"n":7,"text":"Hush, the crickets sing their sleepy song. The night is calm, the night is long.","sentences":["Hush, the crickets sing their sleepy song.","The night is calm, the night is long."],"image":"sha256:b1bf9f561f58ca07496ec813b0dbb3b0429ae77b1f22476ccb037a60bfe08e2b","alt":"Crickets on a leaf under stars, with a sleeping cat nearby.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:447dd2594d501400984a45e22099c07628ce148894cf8d88b19cb4afa6ecad9b","durationMs":8480,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4764],[4764,8480]],"words":[[0,858],[858,1144],[1144,1906],[1906,2287],[2287,2763],[2763,3335],[3335,4764],[4764,5050],[5050,5526],[5526,5717],[5717,6575],[6575,6861],[6861,7337],[7337,7528],[7528,8480]]}}},{"n":8,"text":"Close your eyes now, nice and slow. Goodnight, goodnight, sleep and grow.","sentences":["Close your eyes now, nice and slow.","Goodnight, goodnight, sleep and grow."],"image":"sha256:88ea76ad37b0b5e519b773244834a25e382a5a309197780fa1ef5d220614b89f","alt":"A small child asleep under a soft blanket with a moon at the window.","audio":{"hash":"sha256:7ac49baa5fdf634c93ad02e8e0a016a0c002e65f2f62c24887